  "body": "Positioned in one of the North Shore’s most sought-after suburbs, this sunny single-level, two-bedroom brick and tile front unit offers an excellent opportunity to secure a well-located home in the heart of Milford.\r\n\r\nSet in a small block of three and enjoying a superb front position, this well-presented property combines convenience, comfort and long-term appeal. It is just a short flat walk to Milford Village, North Shore Hospital and Smales Farm, with public transport, motorway access and Milford Beach all close by.\r\n\r\nInside, the home offers practical, easy-care living, including a spacious lounge, sunny conservatory, heat pump, and a recently renovated bathroom featuring both a bathtub and a separate shower.\r\n\r\nParking is well catered for with a single garage, space in front of the garage, and an additional car pad near the entry, providing flexibility for extra vehicles and visitors.\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking to downsize, step onto the property ladder, secure an investment, or simply enjoy an easy-care lifestyle in a premium location, this property is well worth your inspection.\r\n\r\nIt is also zoned for Milford Primary, Westlake Boys’ High School and Westlake Girls’ High School, adding even more value to an already exceptional location.\r\n\r\nCurrently returning $790 per week with tenants on a periodic tenancy, this property also offers flexibility for future plans.\r\n\r\nPrivate sale – contact Joshua directly to arrange a private viewing.",
